  "review": {
    "official": "The leader of the\nGlasgow\nGang's fighters in\nVictoria\n. During\nthe war\n, she fought courageously alongside\nVina Victoria\nand the\nExemplars\n. After the war, she returned to Norport to continue running the Slobberknocker boxing gym. As one of our main points of contact at\nRhodes Island\n's Victoria office, she is often invited to participate in practical combat training (essentially serving as a sparring partner) and occasionally helps Vina Victoria deliver messages back to Rhodes Island.",
    "editor": null,
